B.LM=new A.y("Forest Gate","Kiko invites you into the forest. Many friends are waiting!","Greet friends with a smile \u2014 and everyone feels happy.",B.q)
B.OR=new A.y("Murky Lake","This lake is full of plastic trash. The fish look sad.","Clean water keeps fish healthy. Never throw trash in the water!",B.E)
B.O4=new A.y("Butterfly Flowers","The butterflies are gone. The flowers here are wilting and need care.","Do not pick flowers carelessly \u2014 let them grow for the butterflies.",B.q)
B.OZ=new A.y("Little Mushroom","Mushrooms grow on the old tree. Every creature has its place.","Even small things matter \u2014 respect every living thing.",B.q)
B.Ms=new A.y("Trash on the Path","The little path is full of candy wrappers. Let us clean it up!","Put trash in the bin, wherever you are.",B.E)
B.Ow=new A.y("Banyan Tree","The banyan tree is very old, a home for many birds.","Respect the old \u2014 trees, grandparents, and teachers too.",B.R)
B.Ov=new A.y("Lost Rabbit","A rabbit ran deep into the forest. Let us look for it slowly.","Help a friend who is lost \u2014 that is a kind heart.",B.q)
B.MA=new A.y("Thirsty Deer","The deer is looking for clean water. Help Kiko protect the spring.","A clean spring keeps every creature healthy.",B.E)
B.OL=new A.y("Fruit Garden","The fruit trees bear fruit, but it all fell and was forgotten.","Take just enough, and leave some for others.",B.q)
B.PU=new A.y("The Owl","The owl guards the forest at night. It calls hoo hoo hoo!","Every creature has a job \u2014 even the ones awake at night.",B.q)
B.Px=new A.y("Plastic Trash","Lots of plastic is stuck on the branches. Animals can get trapped!","Plastic does not rot \u2014 sort it, never throw it carelessly.",B.E)
B.MP=new A.y("Squirrel Leaps","Squirrels leap from tree to tree. They need many whole trees.","Do not break the branches \u2014 they are paths for them.",B.q)
B.Pt=new A.y("Baby Deer","A baby deer lost its mother. Help find her!","A child needs a parent, and a parent needs a loving child.",B.q)
B.Mk=new A.y("Dripping Cave","In the cave are lovely stone drips. Look, but do not touch.","Rare and precious things \u2014 admire them, do not break them.",B.K)
B.MJ=new A.y("Honey Bees","The bees work hard to gather honey. Let us watch from far away.","Hard workers deserve respect. Do not disturb their work.",B.R)
B.LX=new A.y("Rippling River","The river flows clean again. The fish are back to play!","See the result? Small work each day makes a healthy forest.",B.E)
B.N7=new A.y("Young Sprout","A new tree sprout starts to grow. One day it will be a big tree.","Small today can be big later. Be patient and caring.",B.q)
B.Lv=new A.y("Bird's Nest","A nest sits on a high branch. Look from afar, do not climb up.","Respect other homes \u2014 even a bird's home.",B.R)
B.Pf=new A.y("Sun Bear","A sun bear walks by. Give it room, do not shout!","Calm and humble \u2014 that is polite, in the forest and at home.",B.R)
B.Lh=new A.y("Rainforest","Rain falls. The leaves get a bath and the forest feels fresh.","Rain is a gift from the sky. Be thankful and use it well.",B.q)
B.Ph=new A.y("Caterpillar Changes","The caterpillar goes into its cocoon. Soon it will be a butterfly!","Be patient \u2014 good things need time to grow.",B.q)
B.O0=new A.y("Forest Ranger","The forest ranger arrives. He guards the forest every day.","Respect those who protect nature \u2014 rangers, teachers, grandparents.",B.R)
B.Lz=new A.y("Trash in Three","The ranger teaches sorting trash: organic, plastic, hazardous.","Sort your trash from now on \u2014 your home stays clean.",B.E)
B.O1=new A.y("Blooming Forest","The flowers bloom again. The butterflies are back!","See? The forest blooms because you cared.",B.q)
B.Nk=new A.y("Forest Party","All the animals gather. They want to say thank you.",'Thanking each other is lovely. Try saying "thank you" today.',B.q)
B.NF=new A.y("Forest Forever","The last day in Kiko's Forest! The final boss awaits.","You are a Forest Keeper now! Bring this good habit into real life.",B.E)
B.a1r=new A.bl([1,B.LM,2,B.OR,3,B.O4,4,B.OZ,5,B.Ms,6,B.Ow,7,B.Ov,8,B.MA,9,B.OL,10,B.PU,11,B.Px,12,B.MP,13,B.Pt,14,B.Mk,15,B.MJ,16,B.LX,17,B.N7,18,B.Lv,19,B.Pf,20,B.Lh,21,B.Ph,22,B.O0,23,B.Lz,24,B.O1,25,B.Nk,26,B.NF],t._4)
B.P3=new A.y("Morning Beach","The sun rises. Kiko invites you for a walk on the beach!","A good morning starts with a cheerful heart.",B.q)
B.NG=new A.y("Trash in the Sand","Plastic bottles are scattered everywhere. The beach is dirty.","Take your trash home \u2014 or use the beach bin.",B.E)
B.LI=new A.y("Pretty Shells","Colorful shells wash ashore. Look, but leave them there.","Keep the memory with your eyes, and leave nature as it is.",B.K)
B.Pz=new A.y("Running Crab","A little crab runs to the sea. Give it room!","Make way for the smaller and weaker.",B.q)
B.LA=new A.y("Turtle Eggs","A turtle lays eggs in the sand. They need a safe spot.","Turtle eggs are rare \u2014 protect them, do not take them.",B.q)
B.Ns=new A.y("Reef Fish","A clownfish hides in the anemone. So beautiful!","Every sea creature has its home \u2014 respect it.",B.R)
B.MZ=new A.y("Bottles at Sea","Many bottles float by. Sea animals might swallow them by mistake.","Plastic in the sea is dangerous for fish and whales.",B.E)
B.Lx=new A.y("Pretty Coral","Colorful coral lies below. Thousands of fish live there.","Broken coral takes hundreds of years to grow back \u2014 protect it!",B.E)
B.N2=new A.y("Old Turtle","An old turtle comes by. It has traveled all the oceans!","The old have many stories \u2014 listen carefully.",B.R)
B.NY=new A.y("Baby Turtles","Tiny baby turtles hatch. They must reach the sea.","Do not block them \u2014 let them go home.",B.q)
B.Or=new A.y("Fisherman Pak Eko","Pak Eko is an old fisherman. He tells of the sea long ago.","Respect elders and those who work hard for their family.",B.R)
B.OT=new A.y("Fish Market","At the fish market, everyone is honest about prices. Kiko learns.","Honest trade makes buyers trust you.",B.au)
B.ON=new A.y("Dolphins","Dolphins leap in the sea! They are very smart.","Smart and still kind \u2014 that is true smart.",B.q)
B.Nu=new A.y("Net in the Sand","A fisherman's net lies on the sand, with a crab trapped in it.","Help the trapped \u2014 a small kindness that means a lot.",B.q)
B.ML=new A.y("Rising Tide","The sea water rises. Kiko teaches when it is safe to play.","Obey warnings \u2014 from parents, teachers, and nature too.",B.R)
B.OE=new A.y("Mangrove Forest","The mangroves protect the beach from waves. The trees are strong!",u.N,B.q)
B.Ll=new A.y("Glass Bottle","A broken glass bottle is in the sand. It can hurt passing feet.","Pick up the dangerous \u2014 help others stay safe.",B.E)
B.M4=new A.y("Jellyfish","A jellyfish floats near the shore. Look, but do not touch.","The pretty can sometimes be dangerous \u2014 be careful.",B.K)
B.PI=new A.y("Star Sand","The sand here holds shells like tiny stars.","Small things can be beautiful \u2014 look around you today.",B.q)
B.MV=new A.y("Lost Child","A little child looks for their mother on the beach. Let us help!","Help the lost \u2014 may you always be helped too.",B.q)
B.ME=new A.y("Whale Passes","A big whale passes in the distance. So amazing!","The big is not always scary \u2014 it is just passing by.",B.q)
B.Ls=new A.y("Clean Beach","Kiko invites friends to pick up trash together. A cleaner beach!","Cleanliness is a shared job \u2014 invite your friends.",B.E)
B.Pk=new A.y("Lighthouse","The lighthouse shines every night, guiding ships home safely.","Be like a lighthouse \u2014 give light to others.",B.q)
B.N5=new A.y("Heading Home","Evening comes. The fishermen return with fish for their families.","Today's hard work makes the family happy.",B.q)
B.Mz=new A.y("Turtles Return","The baby turtle from before is big now! It returns to the beach.","What you protect will come back to say thank you.",B.q)
B.Ni=new A.y("Clean Beach Forever","The last day. The final boss and many friends are waiting.","Put trash in the bin \u2014 not just in the game, but every day!",B.E)
