B.Q_=new A.y("Red Light","The light is still red. Many are in a hurry, but Kiko waits.","Wait your turn patiently \u2014 rules keep everyone safe.",B.K)
B.Np=new A.y("Crosswalk","Cross the street at the right spot, look left and right.","Follow road rules \u2014 it keeps you and others safe.",B.K)
