B.Py=new A.y("Dropped Money","Rp10,000 fell on the sidewalk. Kiko knows whose it is.","What is not yours, return it. Honesty makes you rich.",B.au)
B.M0=new A.y("Honest Seller","The seller weighs her goods honestly and exactly.","Support the honest \u2014 buy from those who weigh fairly.",B.au)
B.Os=new A.y("City Park","The park is green and cool. Do not step on the grass or pick flowers.","Care for public places like your own home.",B.E)
B.NJ=new A.y("Lost Child","A little child cries looking for their mom. Walk them to the guard post.","Help those in trouble \u2014 do not ignore them in a crowd.",B.q)
B.OF=new A.y("The Guard","The guard watches the building all day. Greet and thank him.","Appreciate those who keep you safe.",B.R)
B.MM=new A.y("Save Power","The classroom light is on but the room is empty. Kiko turns it off.","Save power and water \u2014 the Earth and the bill thank you.",B.K)
B.M9=new A.y("Honest in a Test","The test is hard. Kiko could peek, but chooses to be honest.","A grade from cheating is empty \u2014 honesty makes you proud.",B.au)
B.Ly=new A.y("A Friend's Promise","Kiko promised to play at 4. Arriving on time keeps the promise.","Keep small promises \u2014 people learn to trust you.",B.au)
B.Ob=new A.y("Careless Litter","Someone drops trash on the street. Kiko picks it up and bins it right.","Set a good example \u2014 do not follow the wrong.",B.E)
B.Nm=new A.y("Pedicab Driver","Pak Dimas the pedicab driver works hard. Pay the right fare.","Pay what you promised \u2014 a small but important promise.",B.au)
B.P1=new A.y("Sharing Lunch","A friend forgot their lunch. Kiko shares his.","Share with those in need \u2014 the heart grows rich.",B.q)
