B.OU=new A.y("Sick Reef","The coral reef turns white from dirty water. Let us help it heal!","Clean seawater means healthy coral. Start at home.",B.E)
B.Q2=new A.y("Stingray","The stingray glides gracefully like it is floating. Just look.","Admire from afar \u2014 do not touch the wild.",B.K)
