B.Oa=new A.y("Shipwreck","An old shipwreck becomes a new home for many fish.","From the broken, new life can be born.",B.q)
B.NO=new A.y("Wise Fisherman","The fisherman takes just enough fish and spares the small ones.","Take just enough \u2014 leave some for tomorrow.",B.K)
B.Ln=new A.y("Light in the Deep","In the deepest sea, the fish glow on their own. Magical!","There is always beauty, even in the darkest place.",B.q)
B.Lq=new A.y("Beach Trash","Trash on the beach is carried by waves to the open sea.","Clean the beach \u2014 you protect the whole sea.",B.E)
