B.PT=new A.y("Liftoff","Kiko rides a rocket into space! Almost there.","Great things start with one brave step.",B.q)
B.MT=new A.y("Astronaut Team","In the rocket, each astronaut has a job. Kiko holds his part.","A team is strong when everyone does their job.",B.K)
B.Ne=new A.y("Zero Gravity","Things float in space. Tidy them up so nothing gets lost.","Be neat and orderly \u2014 wherever you are.",B.K)
B.LZ=new A.y("Earth from Above","From the window, Earth looks small, blue, and beautiful.","Earth is our only home \u2014 take good care of it.",B.q)
B.Mb=new A.y("Moon Footprint","A footprint on the moon can last thousands of years. Step carefully.","Every step leaves a mark \u2014 choose the good ones.",B.K)
B.LE=new A.y("Save Oxygen","In space, air and water are limited. Use just enough.","Save the limited \u2014 in space and on Earth.",B.K)
B.Nt=new A.y("Star Guide","Long ago, sailors used the stars to find their way.","Learn from those before us \u2014 knowledge is a legacy.",B.R)
B.Pw=new A.y("A Comet Passes","A comet passes only once in thousands of years. Lucky to see it!","Be patient for good things \u2014 and thankful when they come.",B.q)
